1
00:01:57,359 --> 00:01:58,680
Got time to come with me?

2
00:02:01,959 --> 00:02:02,840
Someone wants to see you.

3
00:02:05,159 --> 00:02:07,040
Captain Bai, who are we meeting?

4
00:02:07,439 --> 00:02:08,680
I've got a ton on my plate.

5
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:10,039
I don't have time to wander around here.

6
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:11,840
You'll know soon enough.

7
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:23,159
Zhang Junyan.

8
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:26,719
Actually, I know

9
00:02:26,759 --> 00:02:28,599
you've always had so much to say to him.

10
00:02:29,639 --> 00:02:31,520
Lu Wei, there are many things

11
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:33,479
we just have to face.

12
00:02:34,159 --> 00:02:34,560
Right?

13
00:02:36,759 --> 00:02:37,840
Have a good talk with him.

14
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:41,759
Okay.

15
00:03:18,599 --> 00:03:19,439
Sorry about this.

16
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:21,240
I can't stand up to welcome you.

17
00:03:25,599 --> 00:03:26,000
What?

18
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:28,039
Just because I can't stand,

19
00:03:28,599 --> 00:03:30,199
you can't come over and sit down yourself?

20
00:03:37,039 --> 00:03:38,800
Captain Bai originally wanted me to go see you,

21
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:41,199
but I don't really like your place.

22
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:43,479
So I asked her

23
00:03:44,319 --> 00:03:45,599
to bring you here to see me.

24
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:49,000
Actually,

25
00:03:49,639 --> 00:03:51,120
I should've come to see you a long time ago.

26
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:54,479
It's not like you haven't visited.

27
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:58,680
You just didn't dare let me see you.

28
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:01,400
My legs may be crippled,

29
00:04:01,719 --> 00:04:02,840
but I'm not blind.

30
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:08,840
I'm so sorry.

31
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:11,000
Back then...

32
00:04:11,439 --> 00:04:12,879
What happened back then is long in the past.

33
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:20,959
Did you really never resent me at all?

34
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:24,040
Of course I did.

35
00:04:24,279 --> 00:04:25,720
For the first few years, I really hated you.

36
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:29,600
Honestly,

37
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:33,240
both of us were victims of that accident.

38
00:04:33,759 --> 00:04:34,800
I chose resentment,

39
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:37,720
while you chose guilt.

40
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:44,040
Sometimes when I think about it,

41
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:47,839
we made our lives so exhausting.

42
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:53,920
But these past few years, I've completely let it go.

43
00:04:54,839 --> 00:04:55,800
Look at me now.

44
00:04:57,319 --> 00:04:59,319
Playing chess in the park every day,

45
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:00,480
taking in the scenery,

46
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:02,160
and enjoying life.

47
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:03,439
Isn't this pretty nice?

48
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:17,560
Oh, right.

49
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:20,279
I almost forgot.

50
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:23,560
My daughter wanted me to pass along three words:

51
00:05:24,079 --> 00:05:24,560
"Thank you."

52
00:05:27,879 --> 00:05:29,120
The one who funded my daughter through college,

53
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:30,319
that "Uncle Silly Bear,"

54
00:05:31,399 --> 00:05:32,000
it was you, right?

55
00:05:35,399 --> 00:05:36,040
"Silly Bear."

56
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:38,959
Why pick such an awful name?

57
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:44,879
Still, it actually suits your vibe pretty well.

58
00:05:49,279 --> 00:05:51,079
All right, I'm heading home.

59
00:05:52,279 --> 00:05:53,079
Let me see you out, then.

60
00:05:53,079 --> 00:05:54,839
No need. I don't live far.

61
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:58,120
But...

62
00:06:01,319 --> 00:06:02,800
you still have a long road ahead of you.

63
00:06:04,399 --> 00:06:05,439
Remember to take it easy.

64
00:06:11,399 --> 00:06:11,800
Goodbye.

65
00:06:23,319 --> 00:06:24,639
If it wasn't for you last night,

66
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:27,079
Brother Biao and I probably would've been done for.

67
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:29,920
Do you have any idea

68
00:06:30,040 --> 00:06:31,879
what Brother Biao wants with us today?

69
00:06:32,519 --> 00:06:33,399
How should I know?

70
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:35,839
Brother Biao's been acting so secretive lately.

71
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:39,000
Open that up.

72
00:06:46,439 --> 00:06:47,279
Brother Biao wants you to take it.

73
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:49,439
He said it might come in handy later.

74
00:07:02,319 --> 00:07:03,839
Hello. Thanks for your hard work, everyone.

75
00:07:05,240 --> 00:07:05,920
This is Captain Cheng.

76
00:07:05,959 --> 00:07:06,519
Officer Zhuang.

77
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:07,000
Hello.

78
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:07,480
Thanks for coming.

79
00:07:07,920 --> 00:07:08,399
Must've been a long trip.

80
00:07:13,560 --> 00:07:14,879
That guy over there seems a bit suspicious.

81
00:07:19,439 --> 00:07:20,720
I just saw him on the train.

82
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:22,199
He said he used to be in the military.

83
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:24,199
But he didn't really seem like one.

84
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:27,920
Should we tail him?

85
00:07:28,639 --> 00:07:29,279
Forget it.

86
00:07:29,839 --> 00:07:31,000
We've got plenty of work to do.

87
00:07:31,920 --> 00:07:32,360
Let's go.

88
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:48,040
Brother Guang, that kid didn't tell the boss the truth.

89
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:49,519
We looked into it for two days

90
00:07:49,879 --> 00:07:51,040
before we finally found his wife's address.

91
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:54,040
I called you earlier, but it didn't go through.

92
00:07:54,839 --> 00:07:57,160
Probably had no signal in the car.

93
00:07:57,759 --> 00:08:00,040
By the way, Xiao Feng is still waiting for word from us.

94
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:02,199
Should we give Xiao Feng a call first?

95
00:08:05,759 --> 00:08:06,199
No need.

96
00:08:07,319 --> 00:08:08,160
Let's just head straight over to him.

97
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:08,959
All right.

98
00:08:13,759 --> 00:08:16,680
Here is the suspect information provided by the police:

99
00:08:17,199 --> 00:08:18,680
Li Qiang, male, 35 years old,

100
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:19,920
182 centimeters tall,

101
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:21,560
armed with a firearm.

102
00:08:21,800 --> 00:08:24,160
If any citizens spot the suspect,

103
00:08:24,399 --> 00:08:25,920
please notify the police immediately.

104
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:27,079
Turn it off, turn it off.

105
00:08:30,319 --> 00:08:33,159
Bro, who are we going to see this time?

106
00:08:33,519 --> 00:08:36,159
The guy just wanted on the radio.

107
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:37,879
Li Qiang.

108
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:40,679
Why, you know him?

109
00:08:41,679 --> 00:08:42,879
In the news lately,

110
00:08:43,399 --> 00:08:44,399
he pops up all the time.

111
00:08:44,799 --> 00:08:45,879
Didn't he cause us trouble before?

112
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:47,080
Why are we meeting him then?

113
00:08:47,639 --> 00:08:50,159
He lost a fortune recently,

114
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:52,440
and now he's wanted by the cops.

115
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:54,440
He's practically a stray dog now.

116
00:08:55,159 --> 00:08:56,480
The reason he reached out to us

117
00:08:56,639 --> 00:08:58,960
is to help him offload a shipment.

118
00:08:59,399 --> 00:09:01,200
He's got nowhere to turn,

119
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:03,559
so it's the perfect chance to rip him off.

120
00:09:03,759 --> 00:09:06,799
Bro, but Li Qiang isn't easy to mess with.

121
00:09:07,559 --> 00:09:09,360
What if we fail to play him,

122
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:10,919
and he takes us out instead?

123
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:12,320
Look at what a coward you are.

124
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:14,200
What was it like before?

125
00:09:15,879 --> 00:09:18,279
No guns, no muscle.

126
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:19,799
What about now?

127
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:25,440
We've got both the men and the guns.

128
00:09:25,519 --> 00:09:27,240
What the hell are you afraid of?

129
00:09:28,799 --> 00:09:30,759
Every cop in the city is hunting him down.

130
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:32,320
Dealing with him,

131
00:09:34,279 --> 00:09:35,679
I'm afraid we'll get burned.

132
00:09:35,919 --> 00:09:37,440
I think we've got to be extra careful.

133
00:09:40,120 --> 00:09:41,080
Fair point.

134
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:17,120
No wonder.

135
00:10:17,799 --> 00:10:20,799
Boss Liang sounded so arrogant on the phone.

136
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:22,279
Turns out you brought backup.

137
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:25,240
You're kidding, Brother Qiang.

138
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:27,960
I, Liang Wenbiao, don't have many virtues,

139
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:29,039
but I love making friends.

140
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:31,360
I've always seen you as a friend too, Brother Qiang.

141
00:10:32,240 --> 00:10:33,080
But I know

142
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:36,720
you have no time to talk feelings right now.

143
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:38,440
Let's get straight to money.

144
00:10:43,600 --> 00:10:45,360
Twenty kilograms of Psychedelic Blues,

145
00:10:45,519 --> 00:10:46,639
ten kilograms of No. 4.

146
00:10:49,679 --> 00:10:50,519
Are you in or not?

147
00:10:51,559 --> 00:10:52,480
That's quite a haul.

148
00:10:54,080 --> 00:10:55,480
But in Nanhai, it seems

149
00:10:56,399 --> 00:10:57,919
very few people can take that much.

150
00:11:01,919 --> 00:11:03,480
How many venues do you run?

151
00:11:03,639 --> 00:11:04,799
You don't need me to tell you that.

152
00:11:06,960 --> 00:11:08,039
I get what you mean.

153
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:09,879
How about this:

154
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:12,320
if you take all the goods at once,

155
00:11:13,840 --> 00:11:15,120
I'll give you a ten-percent cut of the profit.

156
00:11:19,759 --> 00:11:21,159
Everyone wants to make money.

157
00:11:21,679 --> 00:11:24,480
But you're in the spotlight in Nanhai, Brother Qiang.

158
00:11:24,639 --> 00:11:26,879
Doing business with you is too risky.

159
00:11:27,440 --> 00:11:29,480
Just for a ten-percent discount,

160
00:11:30,039 --> 00:11:31,240
taking such a massive risk...

161
00:11:32,679 --> 00:11:34,039
I don't think it's worth it.

162
00:11:34,480 --> 00:11:35,399
You're pushing your luck—

163
00:11:37,399 --> 00:11:37,919
What are you doing?

164
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:39,639
Want to shoot?

165
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:41,279
Then let's die together!

166
00:11:41,960 --> 00:11:42,480
Put it down.

167
00:11:43,360 --> 00:11:43,720
Put it down!

168
00:11:51,600 --> 00:11:53,200
My boy has quite a temper.

169
00:11:53,720 --> 00:11:54,639
I'll keep him in line.

170
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:58,080
We came here today to talk business.

171
00:11:58,679 --> 00:12:00,519
Boss Liang, with the terms I offered,

172
00:12:00,720 --> 00:12:02,759
I don't see any reason for you to refuse.

173
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:08,559
Normally, there wouldn't be any.

174
00:12:10,159 --> 00:12:11,559
But things are different now.

175
00:12:12,159 --> 00:12:13,399
You're in a hurry to flee,

176
00:12:13,919 --> 00:12:15,240
desperate to offload your goods.

177
00:12:17,399 --> 00:12:18,159
As for me?

178
00:12:20,080 --> 00:12:21,039
I have my suppliers.

179
00:12:23,159 --> 00:12:24,840
I don't have to make this deal.

180
00:12:26,679 --> 00:12:28,360
Since I have such an advantage,

181
00:12:29,080 --> 00:12:30,159
tell me, Brother Qiang,

182
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:33,960
shouldn't I push my advantage?

183
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:44,279
Push your advantage,

184
00:12:45,399 --> 00:12:46,840
or quit while you're ahead?

185
00:12:47,159 --> 00:12:48,480
You'd better think this through.

186
00:12:49,559 --> 00:12:51,399
You think because the cops are after us,

187
00:12:52,759 --> 00:12:54,440
you can kick us while we're down?

188
00:12:55,200 --> 00:12:55,799
Don't forget,

189
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:59,320
we're in the same boat.

190
00:13:00,559 --> 00:13:01,799
If we go down,

191
00:13:02,559 --> 00:13:04,600
you could very well be next.

192
00:13:21,200 --> 00:13:22,320
Have you lost your mind?

193
00:13:22,519 --> 00:13:23,720
I just want to see

194
00:13:24,360 --> 00:13:26,120
if your boys will shoot.

195
00:13:43,279 --> 00:13:44,320
What's your name?

196
00:13:55,159 --> 00:13:56,039
Not bad.

197
00:13:56,759 --> 00:13:57,480
Pretty tough.

198
00:14:04,039 --> 00:14:05,519
Things are a bit tense, aren't they?

199
00:14:06,840 --> 00:14:08,440
Are we doing business or not?

200
00:14:14,919 --> 00:14:15,639
20 percent.

201
00:14:48,519 --> 00:14:49,720
Here's the shipment from Mr. Jiang.

202
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:50,559
Thank you.

203
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:03,519
Boss,

204
00:15:06,879 --> 00:15:08,440
I've already found a freight company for you.

205
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:10,960
This afternoon, we'll go to the processing plant

206
00:15:11,279 --> 00:15:12,840
and hide the goods inside some timber.

207
00:15:13,159 --> 00:15:14,240
We'll set off tonight.

208
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:15,720
In less than 30 hours,

209
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:16,960
we can reach Jiangyang.

210
00:15:18,879 --> 00:15:19,240
Good.

211
00:15:29,559 --> 00:15:30,840
Boss, Brother Qiang is on the line.

212
00:15:35,440 --> 00:15:35,919
Boss.

213
00:15:37,120 --> 00:15:38,879
How are things going on your end?

214
00:15:39,200 --> 00:15:41,200
Right now, the only one who can take that much product

215
00:15:41,360 --> 00:15:42,159
is Liang Wenbiao.

216
00:15:43,519 --> 00:15:44,440
But he wants a 20 percent cut.

217
00:15:45,159 --> 00:15:47,000
Not sure if Chen Hai will have an issue with that.

218
00:15:48,960 --> 00:15:52,360
The Nanhai police are after you right now.

219
00:15:52,679 --> 00:15:54,120
You can't get away while holding the goods.

220
00:15:54,799 --> 00:15:56,679
Either way, unload the goods first.

221
00:15:57,200 --> 00:16:00,559
Also, don't route the payment through Chen Hai.

222
00:16:01,240 --> 00:16:02,840
Have Liang Wenbiao pay you in cash.

223
00:16:03,440 --> 00:16:04,519
Or have him wire the money

224
00:16:04,879 --> 00:16:06,840
to your sister-in-law's overseas account.

225
00:16:07,440 --> 00:16:08,159
If we do that,

226
00:16:08,960 --> 00:16:10,559
won't Pi Yazi turn on us?

227
00:16:12,600 --> 00:16:15,039
We've messed up twice in Nanhai.

228
00:16:15,919 --> 00:16:17,000
Even if he doesn't turn on me,

229
00:16:17,519 --> 00:16:19,200
I'm going to settle scores with him anyway.

230
00:16:20,159 --> 00:16:21,440
I'll handle this matter.

231
00:16:21,559 --> 00:16:22,559
Don't worry about it.

232
00:16:22,759 --> 00:16:23,559
What matters most right now

233
00:16:23,759 --> 00:16:27,200
is for you to get out of Nanhai safely.

234
00:16:27,639 --> 00:16:27,960
All right.

235
00:16:28,759 --> 00:16:29,759
We'll do it your way.

236
00:16:30,759 --> 00:16:31,240
And one more thing.

237
00:16:32,519 --> 00:16:33,919
Tell Liang Wenbiao

238
00:16:34,919 --> 00:16:36,399
that for any future shipments,

239
00:16:36,639 --> 00:16:39,399
my prices will be ten percent lower than the others.

240
00:16:39,919 --> 00:16:42,120
I'm heading back to Jiangyang tonight.

241
00:16:42,799 --> 00:16:44,360
Lao Qin will be waiting for you in Country M.

242
00:16:44,399 --> 00:16:45,919
Stay safe on the road.

243
00:16:46,320 --> 00:16:46,759
Got it.

244
00:16:55,200 --> 00:16:56,200
My boss said

245
00:16:56,519 --> 00:16:57,320
you can have your 20 percent cut,

246
00:16:57,960 --> 00:16:59,279
as our introductory gift.

247
00:16:59,679 --> 00:17:01,399
Whenever you take goods from us in the future,

248
00:17:02,480 --> 00:17:03,840
you'll make an extra ten percent.

249
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:09,400
Pleasure doing business with you.

250
00:17:34,720 --> 00:17:35,319
Li Liping

251
00:17:35,519 --> 00:17:37,519
works as a teacher at Chenguang Kindergarten.

252
00:17:38,160 --> 00:17:39,519
According to our past files,

253
00:17:39,759 --> 00:17:41,200
regarding Qian Feng's drug deals,

254
00:17:41,440 --> 00:17:42,359
she's likely in the dark.

255
00:17:42,920 --> 00:17:44,160
However, what we don't know is

256
00:17:44,960 --> 00:17:47,000
whether she knows about his criminal activities.

257
00:17:48,279 --> 00:17:50,079
Ever since Li Liping divorced Qian Feng,

258
00:17:50,240 --> 00:17:51,640
she has been raising the child alone.

259
00:17:52,039 --> 00:17:53,079
Their daughter, Qian Shu,

260
00:17:53,279 --> 00:17:55,160
attends third grade at Chipiankou Primary School.

261
00:17:55,480 --> 00:17:58,680
When does Qian Shu usually go home?

262
00:17:59,200 --> 00:18:01,519
Usually, after school on Friday,

263
00:18:02,440 --> 00:18:03,920
Li Liping comes to pick her up.

264
00:18:04,359 --> 00:18:06,119
Qian Feng usually arrives Saturday afternoon

265
00:18:06,119 --> 00:18:07,519
in Yangchuan to meet the mother and daughter.

266
00:18:08,119 --> 00:18:09,680
Still, in case he shows up early,

267
00:18:09,920 --> 00:18:11,240
at Chipiankou Primary School

268
00:18:11,240 --> 00:18:12,480
and near Li Liping's home,

269
00:18:12,680 --> 00:18:13,920
we've stationed officers on stakeout.

270
00:18:20,799 --> 00:18:23,160
And the officers staked out at the school,

271
00:18:23,240 --> 00:18:24,000
how many are there?

272
00:18:24,400 --> 00:18:25,440
Based on our investigation,

273
00:18:25,839 --> 00:18:27,920
Qian Feng has never picked up his daughter at school.

274
00:18:28,119 --> 00:18:29,480
So we focused our main police force

275
00:18:29,480 --> 00:18:31,240
near Li Liping's home.

276
00:18:31,559 --> 00:18:33,319
Outside the school gate, there are only two officers.

277
00:18:33,759 --> 00:18:34,200
Of course,

278
00:18:34,319 --> 00:18:35,720
we also face practical limitations.

279
00:18:35,920 --> 00:18:37,079
We don't have enough manpower

280
00:18:37,079 --> 00:18:38,039
to dispatch any more officers.

281
00:18:38,519 --> 00:18:39,880
The primary mission of those two officers

282
00:18:40,039 --> 00:18:41,319
is strictly surveillance and tailing.

283
00:18:41,519 --> 00:18:42,880
The moment Qian Feng is spotted,

284
00:18:43,119 --> 00:18:44,440
they'll report back to us immediately.

285
00:18:44,759 --> 00:18:46,240
Our team will then immediately launch

286
00:18:46,400 --> 00:18:47,319
a full-scale arrest operation.

287
00:19:09,319 --> 00:19:11,400
We'll detour from Country L to Jiangyang.

288
00:19:11,400 --> 00:19:13,039
Although this route is a bit tougher,

289
00:19:13,400 --> 00:19:15,319
border control here is more relaxed.

290
00:19:16,279 --> 00:19:18,119
And the arrival time in Jiangyang is about the same.

291
00:19:20,160 --> 00:19:21,319
Once we get used to this route,

292
00:19:22,039 --> 00:19:23,119
business will be much easier.

293
00:19:23,400 --> 00:19:24,039
To be honest, Mr. Ma,

294
00:19:25,319 --> 00:19:26,680
moving goods out of Country M

295
00:19:26,680 --> 00:19:27,880
isn't really that hard.

296
00:19:28,240 --> 00:19:29,720
What worries me most right now

297
00:19:29,720 --> 00:19:30,759
is mainland China.

298
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:34,319
Inspections are pretty tight over there now.

299
00:19:34,680 --> 00:19:36,759
But I know the domestic routes well.

300
00:19:37,039 --> 00:19:37,640
What's more,

301
00:19:37,680 --> 00:19:40,200
how the sales channels communicate—

302
00:19:40,359 --> 00:19:41,599
I know that inside out.

303
00:19:43,039 --> 00:19:44,240
The clients I have on hand

304
00:19:44,640 --> 00:19:46,039
can keep us going for two years.

305
00:19:47,519 --> 00:19:48,240
Don't worry.

306
00:19:49,200 --> 00:19:49,960
That's why I've always said

307
00:19:49,960 --> 00:19:51,599
you're no ordinary man, Mr. Ma.

308
00:19:51,759 --> 00:19:54,599
Otherwise, I wouldn't have chosen to work with you.

309
00:20:37,920 --> 00:20:38,599
Right here.

310
00:20:42,400 --> 00:20:43,279
This batch of timber

311
00:20:43,680 --> 00:20:45,079
was ordered from a company.

312
00:20:45,160 --> 00:20:46,759
All customs paperwork is legitimate

313
00:20:46,759 --> 00:20:47,839
and fully in order.

314
00:20:47,920 --> 00:20:50,440
Our shipment will be transported

315
00:20:50,440 --> 00:20:51,720
together with this timber to Jiangyang.

316
00:20:52,319 --> 00:20:54,880
There shouldn't be any issues.

317
00:20:55,200 --> 00:20:55,759
Mr. Qin,

318
00:20:56,440 --> 00:20:58,200
what is all this wood used for?

319
00:20:59,319 --> 00:21:00,319
It's used for indoor staircases.

320
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:02,880
A lot of people made fortunes off it.

321
00:21:08,279 --> 00:21:10,079
The quality of this wood is really great.

322
00:21:11,440 --> 00:21:12,519
My dad was a carpenter.

323
00:21:13,039 --> 00:21:14,039
He always hoped

324
00:21:14,240 --> 00:21:15,920
that I'd become a carpenter too when I grew up.

325
00:21:18,519 --> 00:21:18,960
Brother,

326
00:21:19,720 --> 00:21:20,839
once I've made enough money,

327
00:21:21,200 --> 00:21:23,000
I'll open a furniture factory abroad

328
00:21:23,119 --> 00:21:24,880
to make custom pieces exclusively for the rich.

329
00:21:25,559 --> 00:21:26,079
Xiao Xiao,

330
00:21:26,640 --> 00:21:28,559
after you've made your fortune,

331
00:21:28,839 --> 00:21:30,559
haven't you thought of just enjoying life abroad?

332
00:21:32,039 --> 00:21:33,920
Following in his footsteps will fulfill his dream.

333
00:21:35,799 --> 00:21:36,119
Let's go.

334
00:21:54,640 --> 00:21:55,480
Old Ma, what do you think?

335
00:22:00,640 --> 00:22:01,839
It's a solid plan.

336
00:22:03,319 --> 00:22:04,640
I've already rented this place.

337
00:22:05,039 --> 00:22:06,880
It'll make moving our goods easy.

338
00:22:09,359 --> 00:22:09,640
Old Qin.

339
00:22:10,240 --> 00:22:12,000
The workers in this factory...

340
00:22:12,319 --> 00:22:12,880
are they reliable?

341
00:22:14,640 --> 00:22:16,480
Reliability doesn't matter with these people.

342
00:22:17,200 --> 00:22:17,799
As long as they get this,

343
00:22:18,359 --> 00:22:19,319
they won't say a word.

344
00:22:23,279 --> 00:22:24,599
Boss, the police are here!

345
00:22:25,039 --> 00:22:25,599
Go check it out, quick!

346
00:22:25,799 --> 00:22:26,319
Right away!

347
00:22:29,599 --> 00:22:30,680
I just rented this place.

348
00:22:30,680 --> 00:22:31,720
How do the cops already know?

349
00:22:48,039 --> 00:22:49,039
Boss, let's get out of here!

350
00:22:49,160 --> 00:22:50,039
If we don't leave now, we won't make it!

351
00:22:50,559 --> 00:22:53,359
No way. This shipment has to reach Jiangyang.

352
00:22:53,960 --> 00:22:55,440
Otherwise, your sister-in-law is dead.

353
00:23:04,599 --> 00:23:05,720
Lao Ma, hurry up!

354
00:23:05,839 --> 00:23:06,680
We're running out of time!

355
00:23:50,440 --> 00:23:51,720
Boss, hurry, let's go!

356
00:23:51,720 --> 00:23:52,200
Move.

357
00:24:03,319 --> 00:24:03,920
Let's go!

358
00:24:14,559 --> 00:24:15,160
Hurry, go!

359
00:24:15,839 --> 00:24:17,359
You're the only one who knows the buyer in Jiangyang.

360
00:24:17,519 --> 00:24:19,519
Sell the goods, take the cash, and save your sister-in-law.

361
00:24:19,559 --> 00:24:20,440
Brother!

362
00:24:20,680 --> 00:24:21,279
Just go!

363
00:24:21,680 --> 00:24:22,079
Go!

364
00:24:52,160 --> 00:24:53,000
I surrender!

365
00:25:02,759 --> 00:25:03,880
I—I surrender!

366
00:25:25,079 --> 00:25:26,759
You always pick this place to meet.

367
00:25:27,519 --> 00:25:29,759
Is the scenery here that great?

368
00:25:32,319 --> 00:25:33,359
The Nanhai police

369
00:25:33,359 --> 00:25:35,400
issued a citywide manhunt this afternoon.

370
00:25:36,279 --> 00:25:37,920
Did your men blow it?

371
00:25:38,839 --> 00:25:40,440
Didn't I already tell you?

372
00:25:41,000 --> 00:25:43,680
Your message was delivered to Qian Feng.

373
00:25:43,720 --> 00:25:45,079
What else are you worried about?

374
00:25:49,880 --> 00:25:51,359
I know what you're thinking.

375
00:25:51,880 --> 00:25:52,440
Relax.

376
00:25:53,079 --> 00:25:55,400
If the cops want to find my man,

377
00:25:55,960 --> 00:25:56,960
it won't be that easy.

378
00:25:58,160 --> 00:26:00,319
Once we deal with Qian Feng,

379
00:26:00,480 --> 00:26:03,359
things will blow over.

380
00:26:11,720 --> 00:26:12,839
Li Liping's home is just ahead.

381
00:26:12,960 --> 00:26:14,640
It'll take us about 15 minutes to get there.

382
00:26:15,200 --> 00:26:16,480
Qian Feng knows the police are looking for him.

383
00:26:16,880 --> 00:26:17,880
He'll be extra careful.

384
00:26:18,039 --> 00:26:19,079
He shouldn't be going home right now.

385
00:26:20,640 --> 00:26:21,720
Qian Feng loves his daughter dearly.

386
00:26:22,359 --> 00:26:23,480
Over the past three years,

387
00:26:23,680 --> 00:26:25,160
he visited her every weekend.

388
00:26:26,079 --> 00:26:27,079
Family ties are priceless, after all.

389
00:26:27,839 --> 00:26:29,839
So even while on the run,

390
00:26:30,240 --> 00:26:32,240
he'd make time to see Qian Shu.

391
00:26:32,440 --> 00:26:33,319
That's why I think

392
00:26:33,880 --> 00:26:34,640
at this time of day,

393
00:26:35,359 --> 00:26:36,480
it's unlikely he'll head home.

394
00:26:37,079 --> 00:26:38,319
He's more likely to go to school to see his daughter.

395
00:26:39,440 --> 00:26:40,000
I agree.

396
00:26:40,880 --> 00:26:42,160
Qian Feng is on the run.

397
00:26:42,559 --> 00:26:43,920
We can't rely on his usual habits

398
00:26:43,920 --> 00:26:45,400
to predict his next move.

399
00:26:45,880 --> 00:26:47,160
What if Qian Feng heads straight home?

400
00:26:47,920 --> 00:26:48,759
No one can say for sure right now.

401
00:26:49,640 --> 00:26:51,200
That's why we staked out both locations

402
00:26:51,640 --> 00:26:52,400
to cover all bases.

403
00:26:56,799 --> 00:26:58,599
Captain Lu sent over the suspect's composite sketch.

404
00:27:07,799 --> 00:27:08,359
That's him.

405
00:27:10,720 --> 00:27:11,359
How do you know?

406
00:27:11,960 --> 00:27:13,160
I ran into him on the train.

407
00:27:14,240 --> 00:27:15,680
He had a shooter's callus on his hand.

408
00:27:17,039 --> 00:27:17,599
Are you sure?

409
00:27:19,119 --> 00:27:19,480
Positive.

410
00:27:21,119 --> 00:27:21,720
So that means

411
00:27:21,920 --> 00:27:23,519
he arrived on the same train as us.

412
00:27:24,079 --> 00:27:25,799
Someone picked the suspect up when he got off.

413
00:27:26,119 --> 00:27:26,960
In that case,

414
00:27:27,559 --> 00:27:28,759
he isn't working alone this time.

415
00:27:30,279 --> 00:27:31,599
We've been wondering

416
00:27:31,839 --> 00:27:33,319
what this suspect's motive is.

417
00:27:34,160 --> 00:27:36,279
Ruling out helping Qian Feng flee or silencing him,

418
00:27:36,720 --> 00:27:38,759
what other possibility could there be?

419
00:27:40,319 --> 00:27:41,319
Here's the situation:

420
00:27:41,599 --> 00:27:42,880
Qian Feng's cover has been blown.

421
00:27:43,079 --> 00:27:45,240
If we were the drug cartel behind Qian Feng,

422
00:27:45,279 --> 00:27:47,279
why would we send this suspect out?

423
00:27:47,960 --> 00:27:50,000
The cartel has only one objective:

424
00:27:50,359 --> 00:27:52,839
prevent Qian Feng from giving the police

425
00:27:52,880 --> 00:27:54,000
any information about their higher-ups.

426
00:27:55,240 --> 00:27:56,400
This Qian Feng...

427
00:27:59,680 --> 00:28:01,160
he's hiding plenty of secrets.

428
00:28:01,759 --> 00:28:02,279
Qian Shu!

429
00:28:05,400 --> 00:28:06,759
I'll notify the officers over there right now.

430
00:28:57,839 --> 00:28:58,359
Mom!

431
00:29:01,240 --> 00:29:02,279
My dad is driving over.

432
00:29:02,279 --> 00:29:04,400
Why don't you ride with us?

433
00:29:04,440 --> 00:29:05,920
Yeah, let's go together.

434
00:29:05,920 --> 00:29:06,599
We can drop you off.

435
00:29:06,599 --> 00:29:07,240
No, that's okay.

436
00:29:07,240 --> 00:29:09,279
My mom will be here to pick me up soon.

437
00:29:09,440 --> 00:29:11,079
All right then, bye!

438
00:29:11,920 --> 00:29:12,599
Bye!

439
00:29:14,200 --> 00:29:15,400
Qian Shu has reached the school gate.

440
00:29:15,839 --> 00:29:17,200
Everyone, keep an eye out for the suspect.

441
00:29:18,759 --> 00:29:19,200
Goodbye.

442
00:29:19,400 --> 00:29:19,960
Bye.

443
00:29:21,960 --> 00:29:23,279
The suspect is very likely nearby.

444
00:29:24,079 --> 00:29:25,279
Have your team keep a close eye on Qian Shu.

445
00:29:25,599 --> 00:29:26,200
We're getting out.

446
00:30:56,000 --> 00:30:57,000
There's a man in sunglasses

447
00:30:57,039 --> 00:30:58,640
and a cap crossing the street.

448
00:30:58,960 --> 00:31:00,000
Ge Dan, go check it out.

449
00:31:00,440 --> 00:31:00,799
Copy that.

450
00:31:20,359 --> 00:31:21,519
Target confirmed as Qian Feng.

451
00:31:21,960 --> 00:31:23,680
All units, prepare to move in.

452
00:31:24,200 --> 00:31:24,599
Hold on.

453
00:31:26,039 --> 00:31:27,079
The suspect hasn't shown up yet.

454
00:31:27,400 --> 00:31:28,519
Tell your men to hold.

455
00:31:28,880 --> 00:31:29,440
Officer Zhuang,

456
00:31:30,160 --> 00:31:31,880
this is our best chance to take Qian Feng.

457
00:31:32,839 --> 00:31:34,440
The suspect might not have found him yet.

458
00:31:36,039 --> 00:31:38,000
Wait a bit longer. We might get both.

459
00:31:38,359 --> 00:31:38,640
All right.

460
00:31:43,519 --> 00:31:44,799
Has anyone seen Li Liping?

461
00:31:46,200 --> 00:31:47,319
Has anyone seen Li Liping?

462
00:31:47,839 --> 00:31:48,960
Report her location the moment you see her.

463
00:31:54,680 --> 00:31:55,119
Xiaoshu!

464
00:31:56,240 --> 00:31:56,839
Daddy!

465
00:31:59,400 --> 00:31:59,880
School's out?

466
00:32:00,880 --> 00:32:02,000
Daddy's picking you up today.

467
00:32:03,119 --> 00:32:04,559
But Mommy isn't here yet.

468
00:32:06,519 --> 00:32:07,440
You're a big girl now.

469
00:32:08,119 --> 00:32:09,200
Why do you always insist

470
00:32:09,200 --> 00:32:10,240
on having Mommy pick you up?

471
00:32:10,480 --> 00:32:11,400
I'm taking you home today.

472
00:32:11,599 --> 00:32:12,880
Let's wait for Mommy at home, okay?

473
00:32:13,559 --> 00:32:14,319
Didn't you say

474
00:32:14,319 --> 00:32:16,240
never to go home alone after school

475
00:32:16,279 --> 00:32:17,799
and wait for Mommy to pick me up?

476
00:32:19,160 --> 00:32:20,119
You were little back then.

477
00:32:20,880 --> 00:32:21,839
You're all grown up now.

478
00:32:22,079 --> 00:32:22,599
Be a good girl.

479
00:32:23,039 --> 00:32:24,359
Let's wait for Mommy at home, okay?

480
00:32:27,920 --> 00:32:29,160
Mommy's calling!

481
00:32:30,920 --> 00:32:31,559
Mommy!

482
00:32:32,480 --> 00:32:34,319
Yes, I'm with Daddy!

483
00:32:35,720 --> 00:32:36,480
Hold on.

484
00:32:41,319 --> 00:32:42,640
Mommy wants to talk to you.

485
00:32:46,480 --> 00:32:47,000
Liping?

486
00:32:48,559 --> 00:32:50,839
Qian Feng, take the kid and run!

487
00:32:51,039 --> 00:32:51,920
Qian Feng.

488
00:32:55,839 --> 00:32:56,640
Qian Feng.

489
00:32:57,039 --> 00:32:59,319
You weren't easy to track down.

490
00:33:02,000 --> 00:33:04,079
Looks like someone's watching Qian Feng.

491
00:33:04,440 --> 00:33:05,359
Everyone, hold your positions.

492
00:33:08,319 --> 00:33:08,920
What do you want?

493
00:33:10,319 --> 00:33:12,079
Whatever it is, take it out on me!

494
00:33:12,359 --> 00:33:14,240
If you lay a finger on my family...

495
00:33:14,519 --> 00:33:15,559
Don't get cocky.

496
00:33:15,559 --> 00:33:16,359
You think I won't

497
00:33:16,640 --> 00:33:19,240
have someone blow your wife's brains out right now?

498
00:33:24,559 --> 00:33:25,400
Come on.

499
00:33:26,640 --> 00:33:27,720
Look to your right.

500
00:33:33,200 --> 00:33:35,480
Right. Turn a little more.

501
00:33:41,759 --> 00:33:42,640
My wife has nothing to do with this!

502
00:33:43,000 --> 00:33:43,839
Let her go right now!

503
00:33:48,240 --> 00:33:49,160
To my front left.

504
00:33:49,400 --> 00:33:50,240
Suspect vehicle.

505
00:33:50,559 --> 00:33:52,839
Mercedes MPV, plate ends in 763.

506
00:33:53,440 --> 00:33:55,440
Listen to me carefully, Qian Feng.

507
00:33:55,920 --> 00:33:57,920
The police are watching you like hawks.

508
00:33:58,039 --> 00:33:59,440
You have no chance of escaping.

509
00:34:00,400 --> 00:34:02,839
Boss Chen has a message for you.

510
00:34:06,839 --> 00:34:07,759
What you need to do,

511
00:34:08,239 --> 00:34:09,719
I've already made very clear.

512
00:34:10,519 --> 00:34:11,840
As long as you do as you're told,

513
00:34:12,599 --> 00:34:15,559
the boss will take good care of your family.

514
00:34:15,880 --> 00:34:17,559
But if you dare say

515
00:34:17,559 --> 00:34:19,000
even a single word to the police,

516
00:34:21,159 --> 00:34:22,280
then get ready

517
00:34:23,239 --> 00:34:24,559
to collect your wife's corpse.

518
00:34:25,599 --> 00:34:25,960
No...

519
00:34:27,960 --> 00:34:29,599
ex-wife, rather.

520
00:34:30,880 --> 00:34:33,119
Then again, I hear

521
00:34:34,039 --> 00:34:35,559
you still love her very much.

522
00:34:36,840 --> 00:34:37,440
Right?

523
00:34:47,000 --> 00:34:47,880
Li Xiao, Ge Dan!

524
00:34:50,800 --> 00:34:52,239
Team A, arrest Qian Feng immediately!

525
00:34:52,239 --> 00:34:53,920
Team B, pursue the suspect vehicle with me!

526
00:34:55,039 --> 00:34:55,639
Liping!

527
00:34:57,440 --> 00:34:58,079
I want Daddy!

528
00:34:58,079 --> 00:34:59,119
They took my wife!

529
00:34:59,119 --> 00:35:00,599
Please, you have to save my wife!

530
00:35:00,599 --> 00:35:01,039
Daddy!

531
00:35:01,480 --> 00:35:02,599
Daddy's here. Don't be scared.

532
00:35:02,800 --> 00:35:03,679
Liping!

533
00:35:03,679 --> 00:35:04,440
Daddy's here. Don't be scared.

534
00:35:47,440 --> 00:35:47,880
Get out of the car.

535
00:35:48,639 --> 00:35:49,119
Ram through.

536
00:36:04,320 --> 00:36:04,760
Drive.

537
00:36:11,199 --> 00:36:11,719
Are you okay?

538
00:36:11,760 --> 00:36:12,039
I'm fine.

539
00:36:12,239 --> 00:36:13,159
Get in.

540
00:38:29,360 --> 00:38:30,639
Center of the square, 11 o'clock, moving north.

541
00:38:30,639 --> 00:38:31,159
Suspect spotted.

542
00:38:31,159 --> 00:38:31,800
Prepare to move in.

543
00:38:48,480 --> 00:38:50,119
Out of the way! Move!

544
00:38:51,559 --> 00:38:52,159
Out of the way!

545
00:38:52,400 --> 00:38:52,840
Freeze!

546
00:38:59,239 --> 00:38:59,800
Stop!

547
00:39:05,800 --> 00:39:06,840
Stop right there! Stop!

548
00:39:07,239 --> 00:39:07,880
Don't run!

549
00:39:13,880 --> 00:39:14,400
Move!

550
00:39:15,840 --> 00:39:17,360
Freeze! Stop! Don't run!

551
00:39:31,000 --> 00:39:31,559
Zhuang Yan!

552
00:39:32,280 --> 00:39:32,679
After him!

553
00:39:42,159 --> 00:39:43,000
Psycho.

554
00:39:43,079 --> 00:39:44,159
Are you crazy?!

555
00:40:48,760 --> 00:40:50,840
Brother Si, I've passed along the boss's message.

556
00:40:58,920 --> 00:40:59,400
Keep driving.

557
00:41:02,639 --> 00:41:03,480
You're not a taxi driver.

558
00:41:03,960 --> 00:41:04,760
Are you in the military?

559
00:41:10,920 --> 00:41:11,599
So it's you.

560
00:41:15,960 --> 00:41:16,360
Wait, no.

561
00:41:35,039 --> 00:41:36,800
Police! I'm commandeering your car.

562
00:41:38,199 --> 00:41:38,760
So that means

563
00:41:39,599 --> 00:41:40,960
you were never an army medic either.

564
00:41:40,960 --> 00:41:41,920
Cut the crap.

565
00:41:42,280 --> 00:41:43,119
Put your hands in front.

566
00:41:49,119 --> 00:41:49,400
Where's the gun?

567
00:42:08,159 --> 00:42:09,559
What's that? Take it out yourself.

568
00:42:13,320 --> 00:42:14,159
Don't try any tricks.

569
00:42:19,239 --> 00:42:20,239
It's 52 percent.

570
00:42:21,199 --> 00:42:21,840
Want a sip?

571
00:42:22,400 --> 00:42:23,280
Cut the crap.

572
00:42:30,079 --> 00:42:30,519
Move it.

573
00:42:33,840 --> 00:42:34,239
Left hand.

574
00:42:39,480 --> 00:42:40,280
Cuff it to the car door.

575
00:42:58,480 --> 00:42:59,119
Let go of me!

576
00:42:59,119 --> 00:42:59,559
Don't move!

577
00:42:59,880 --> 00:43:00,199
Zhuang Yan.

578
00:43:02,840 --> 00:43:03,360
Take him away.

579
00:43:04,400 --> 00:43:04,880
Are you okay?

580
00:43:10,199 --> 00:43:10,599
Li Xiao.

581
00:43:13,519 --> 00:43:13,960
Hello?

582
00:43:14,079 --> 00:43:14,639
Hello?

583
00:43:15,039 --> 00:43:15,440
Old Zhuang.

584
00:43:16,679 --> 00:43:17,320
I caught one here.

585
00:43:17,320 --> 00:43:17,920
Where are you guys?

586
00:43:18,159 --> 00:43:19,000
We're still at the square.

587
00:43:19,039 --> 00:43:19,719
Caught one here too.

588
00:43:21,119 --> 00:43:22,559
Want us to come over to you?

589
00:43:22,639 --> 00:43:24,079
No need. I'll come meet up with you.

590
00:43:26,760 --> 00:43:28,079
Are you okay? Are you hurt?

591
00:43:32,039 --> 00:43:32,440
It hurts.

592
00:43:35,840 --> 00:43:36,199
It's okay.

593
00:43:44,960 --> 00:43:45,960
Don't even think about running.

594
00:43:46,480 --> 00:43:47,280
If you try to run,

595
00:43:48,119 --> 00:43:49,000
I'll shoot you dead.
